  "last_reply": "{\n  \"u0\": \"No client order or fallen-food recovery is outstanding. The agent is between service tasks and should stay ready for a new client to arrive or for carried food to slip; a new order will have to be taken, prepared, and served, while fallen food must be recovered immediately.\",\n  \"u1\": \"A client's order has been taken, but the food for it has not yet been prepared. The agent still needs to fetch a portion if necessary, prepare it at the stove for the waiting client, and then serve the prepared food.\",\n  \"u2\": \"The food for the current order has been prepared, but it has not yet been handed to the client. The agent must serve the prepared food to the waiting client; if it slips, it must be picked up on the very next move before serving can happen.\",\n  \"u3\": \"Food has just slipped out of the agent's hands and is lying on the floor. The only outstanding requirement is to pick it up on the very next move; missing that pickup causes irreversible failure.\",\n  \"u4\": \"An order has been taken and still needs its food prepared, while the raw food has just slipped to the floor. The next move must retrieve the fallen food; afterward, the agent still has to prepare the order and then serve it.\",\n  \"u5\": \"The prepared portion has slipped out of the agent's hands, so it must be picked up on the very next move. Once recovered, it still has to be served to the waiting client.\",\n  \"u6\": \"A client is waiting, but their order has not been taken. The agent needs to take the order, then fetch a portion if needed, prepare it at the stove, and serve the client.\",\n  \"u7\": \"A waiting client's order has not been taken, and prepared food is also waiting to be served. Both duties are outstanding and must eventually be completed.\",\n  \"u8\": \"A client is waiting whose order has not been taken, and food has just fallen. The very next move must pick up the fallen food; afterward, the agent still needs to take the order, prepare food, and serve the client.\",\n  \"u9\": \"A waiting client's order is still untaken, prepared food is still awaiting delivery, and food has just fallen. The next move must retrieve the fallen food or the task fails; taking the order and serving the prepared food remain afterward.\",\n  \"u10\": \"An order has been taken and still needs its food prepared, and a waiting client's order has not yet been taken. The agent must prepare the taken order and take the waiting order; after preparation, that order will still need to be served.\",\n  \"u11\": \"A waiting client's order is untaken, an already-taken order still needs food prepared, and food has just fallen. The next move must pick up the fallen food; afterward, taking the order and preparing the food remain, followed by serving.\",\n  \"u12\": \"An order has been taken but its food has not been prepared, while prepared food is also waiting to be served. The agent must complete both the preparation and the delivery of the prepared food.\",\n  \"u13\": \"An order still awaits preparation, prepared food still awaits serving, and food has just fallen. The immediate next move must pick up the fallen food; after that, the preparation and serving duties remain.\",\n  \"u14\": \"The mandatory rule to pick up fallen food on the very next move has been broken. Successful completion is no longer possible, even if other service duties remain.\",\n  \"u15\": \"Three duties are outstanding: take a waiting client's order, prepare food for an order already taken, and serve prepared food that is waiting. All three must eventually be completed.\",\n  \"u16\": \"Four duties are open at once: take the waiting client's order, prepare food for an order already taken, serve prepared food that is waiting, and recover food that has just fallen. The very next move must pick up the fallen food or the task fails immediately; afterward, the order-taking, preparation, and serving duties remain.\"\n}",
